## 数据流图

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    UploadAPI[/files/* upload/] --> UpFile[(upload_files)]
    DocumentsAPI[/console/datasets/documents/] --> Doc[(documents)]
    Doc --> Indexing[indexing_runner]
    Indexing --> Seg[(document_segments)]
    Seg --> Embed[(embeddings 缓存)]
    Embed --> VDB[(向量数据库)]

    ChatAPI[/console|web|service_api chat/] --> Conv[(conversations)]
    Conv --> Msg[(messages)]
    Msg --> Trace[(链路追踪后端)]

    WFRunAPI[/workflow run/] --> WFRun[(workflow_runs)]
    WFRun --> WFNode[(workflow_node_executions)]
    WFNode --> WFNodeOff[(workflow_node_execution_offload<br>大字段下沉)]
    WFRun --> WFLog[(workflow_app_logs)]
```

## 数据来源与去向

| 来源 | 写入表 | 进一步流向 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 控制台创建应用 | `apps` + `app_model_configs` + `sites`（如发布） | 后续 chat / workflow 都基于此 |
| 工作流编辑保存 | `workflows`（含草稿）+ `workflow_draft_variables` | 运行时读取 |
| 工作流运行 | `workflow_runs` + `workflow_node_executions` + `workflow_node_execution_offload` + `workflow_app_logs` | 写入对象存储原文（大字段） + 链路追踪 |
| Chat 对话 | `conversations` + `messages` + `message_files` + `message_agent_thoughts` | 历史读取 + 反馈写入 |
| 文档上传 | `upload_files` → `documents` → `document_segments`（含 `child_chunks` / `embeddings`） | 向量库 + 对象存储 |
| 触发器创建 | `app_triggers` → `trigger_subscriptions` → `workflow_webhook_triggers` / `workflow_schedule_plans` / `workflow_plugin_triggers` | 触发后写 `workflow_trigger_logs` |
| 模型供应商 | `providers` + `provider_models` + `provider_credentials` + `provider_model_credentials` + `load_balancing_model_configs` | model_manager 调用模型时使用 |
| 工具凭证 | `tool_oauth_*` / `tool_*_providers` / `data_source_*` / `datasource_*` | tools / datasource 调用时使用 |

